# Resend (https://resend.com) -- waitlist capture
# 1. Create a free Resend account.
# 2. Add your sending domain under Domains, then add the DNS records it gives you
#    wherever that domain's DNS is hosted (Cloudflare DNS works fine for this --
#    it's just TXT/MX/CNAME records, no Worker needed).
# 3. Create an API key under API Keys, copy it into RESEND_API_KEY.
# 4. Set these as environment variables in your Vercel project
#    (Project Settings -> Environment Variables), not just in this file --
#    .env files are not deployed.
# Note: Resend's current API has one implicit audience per project -- there
# is no audienceId to configure anymore (an earlier version of this file had
# one; it's been removed).

RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=waitlist@yourdomain.com
